==============================================================================
Third-party software and services
==============================================================================

This repository contains **no third-party source code**. It drives the
following projects and services, each under its own license:

- ShellCrash (https://github.com/juewuy/ShellCrash)
  A transparent-proxy deployment framework for OpenWrt. This repository reads
  and writes the runtime files it manages (`/etc/ShellCrash/`), and
  `openwrt/post-sc-update.sh` restores locally patched files under its
  `starts/` directory.
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0).
  Why used: the device-side scripts assume ShellCrash's directory layout and
  its `start.sh` / `task/task.sh` entry points.

- mihomo / Clash.Meta (https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo)
  The proxy core behind ShellCrash. It defines the `config.yaml` schema, the
  control API used by `mihomo/`, and the `SAFE_PATHS` behavior that
  `openwrt/recover-now.sh` works around.
  Licensed under the MIT License.
  Why used: this repository's diagnostic tools speak its control API and
  reason about its rule semantics.

- OpenWrt (https://openwrt.org)
  The router firmware itself. `openwrt/` scripts target its `rc.local`
  convention, `nftables` subsystem, `busybox` shell and `jsonfilter`/
  `uci` tooling.
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0 (GPL-2.0) for the
  base system.
  Why used: the scripts are meant to run on the device.

- MetaCubeX meta-rules-dat (https://github.com/MetaCubeX/meta-rules-dat)
  The geosite/geoip classification dataset referenced by rules and rulesets.
  This repository does **not** redistribute it; tools fetch it by URL.
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0).

==============================================================================
Derivative works
==============================================================================

`openwrt/post-sc-update.sh` restores **locally patched copies** of ShellCrash's
`starts/` scripts. Those patched files retain the upstream GPL-3.0 copyright
headers and are distributed under GPL-3.0 terms, as recorded in
`docs/UPSTREAM.md`.

==============================================================================
Credentials
==============================================================================

This repository stores **no credentials**. The mihomo control API secret and
the router password are read from environment variables. Device-specific
values (node names, policy-group names, nft table paths) live in
`openwrt/conf/device.conf`, which is not tracked by git.

See docs/SECRETS.md for the location index.
